```

#### CRUD Operations
```python
from pymongo import MongoClient

client = MongoClient('mongodb://localhost:27017/')
db = client['mydb']
collection = db['users']

# Create
user = {"name": "John Doe", "age": 30, "email": "john@example.com"}
result = collection.insert_one(user)
print(result.inserted_id)

